Are you ready to buy black?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0416:b002:l033","ordinal":325351,"en":"Descendant of Kairynam -"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0416:b002:l034","ordinal":325352,"en":"Oh my, Black Giant, is that you?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0416:b002:l035","ordinal":325353,"en":"Oh, his eyes were closed."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0416:b002:l036","ordinal":325354,"en":"He will grant my wish,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0416:b002:l037","ordinal":325355,"en":"Remains of my life"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0416:b002:l038","ordinal":325356,"en":"One of the orphans will come."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0416:b002:l039","ordinal":325357,"en":"Bakai grandfather who was the land"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0416:b002:l040","ordinal":325358,"en":"Someone knows the news."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0416:b003:l001","ordinal":325359,"en":"I knew you would come"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0416:b003:l002","ordinal":325360,"en":"I thought that the bottom would come."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0416:b003:l003","ordinal":325361,"en":"Dig deep and kick"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0416:b003:l004","ordinal":325362,"en":"Even children by hand"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0416:b003:l005","ordinal":325363,"en":"I thought it was coal!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0416:b003:l006","ordinal":325364,"en":"Bleeding bloodshot eyes"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0416:b003:l007","ordinal":325365,"en":"Oh, I thought, I'll see."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0416:b003:l008","ordinal":325366,"en":"The children came and woke up in the morning."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0416:b003:l009","ordinal":325367,"en":"Grandfather Bakay is a dear man"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0416:b003:l010","ordinal":325368,"en":"I thought I was going to die!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0416:b003:l011","ordinal":325369,"en":"My dead children are standing up,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0416:b003:l012","ordinal":325370,"en":"I thought it was coal."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0416:b003:l013","ordinal":325371,"en":"Fast-moving Wide-Kol, wide Talas,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0416:b003:l014","ordinal":325372,"en":"Was the enemy somewhere?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0416:b003:l015","ordinal":325373,"en":"Bere, the soul built by his grandfather Bakai"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0416:b003:l016","ordinal":325374,"en":"Unburied in the field,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0416:b003:l017","ordinal":325375,"en":"Was Joru a man who ate?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0416:b003:l018","ordinal":325376,"en":"Oh, my servant of the Black Giant,"}]
